    <briefdescription>
<para>Map CUDA error code to <ref refid="namespacethemis_1_1gpu_1afe088b91efd54af07cd72da337205c6b" kindref="member">GPUDispatchErrorCode</ref> taxonomy. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>cuda_err</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>CUDA error code </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>Corresponding <ref refid="namespacethemis_1_1gpu_1afe088b91efd54af07cd72da337205c6b" kindref="member">GPUDispatchErrorCode</ref></para>
</simplesect>
Mapping:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>cudaErrorMemoryAllocation → ALLOC_DEVICE_FAILURE</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>cudaErrorInvalidValue → ALLOC_INVALID_PARAMS</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>cudaErrorInvalidDevice → BACKEND_NO_DEVICE_AVAILABLE</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>cudaErrorNotSupported → BACKEND_CAPABILITY_MISMATCH</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>cudaErrorInsufficientDriver → BACKEND_DEGRADED</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>cudaErrorInvalidDevicePointer → INTERNAL_ERROR</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Other → INTERNAL_ERROR</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Map HIP error code to <ref refid="namespacethemis_1_1gpu_1afe088b91efd54af07cd72da337205c6b" kindref="member">GPUDispatchErrorCode</ref> taxonomy.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>hip_err</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>HIP error code </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>Corresponding <ref refid="namespacethemis_1_1gpu_1afe088b91efd54af07cd72da337205c6b" kindref="member">GPUDispatchErrorCode</ref></para>
</simplesect>
Check CUDA error, emit diagnostic, and return error code.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>cuda_err</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>CUDA error code to check </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>context</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Human-readable context (function name, operation description) </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>device_id</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>GPU device ID (-1 if unknown) </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para><ref refid="namespacethemis_1_1gpu_1afe088b91efd54af07cd72da337205c6b" kindref="member">GPUDispatchErrorCode</ref> (SUCCESS if no error)</para>
</simplesect>
Behavior:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>On success: returns SUCCESS (no diagnostic emitted)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>On error: maps error, emits diagnostic, returns error code</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Example: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="namespacethemis_1_1gpu_1afe088b91efd54af07cd72da337205c6b" kindref="member">GPUDispatchErrorCode</ref><sp/>err<sp/>=<sp/>checkCudaError(</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><ref refid="gpu__safe__operations_8h_1a4ecdf944440947b7052c1b8fd828e74f" kindref="member">cudaMalloc</ref>(&amp;ptr,<sp/>size),</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;cudaMalloc&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>device_id);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">if</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>(err<sp/>!=<sp/><ref refid="namespacethemis_1_1gpu_1afe088b91efd54af07cd72da337205c6bad0749aaba8b833466dfcbb0428e4f89c" kindref="member">GPUDispatchErrorCode::SUCCESS</ref>)<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Handle<sp/>error:<sp/>implement<sp/>CPU<sp/>fallback</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para>Check HIP error, emit diagnostic, and return error code.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>hip_err</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>HIP error code to check </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>context</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Human-readable context </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>device_id</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>GPU device ID (-1 if unknown) </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para><ref refid="namespacethemis_1_1gpu_1afe088b91efd54af07cd72da337205c6b" kindref="member">GPUDispatchErrorCode</ref> (SUCCESS if no error)</para>
</simplesect>
RAII guard for fallback-on-error pattern.</para>
<para>Usage pattern for CUDA operations with automatic CPU fallback: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="namespacethemis_1_1gpu_1afe088b91efd54af07cd72da337205c6b" kindref="member">GPUDispatchErrorCode</ref><sp/>final_error<sp/>=<sp/><ref refid="namespacethemis_1_1gpu_1afe088b91efd54af07cd72da337205c6bad0749aaba8b833466dfcbb0428e4f89c" kindref="member">GPUDispatchErrorCode::SUCCESS</ref>;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><ref refid="classthemis_1_1gpu_1_1_cuda_fallback_guard_1a82894f598a434c3361701983011db05f" kindref="member">CudaFallbackGuard</ref><sp/>guard(final_error);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>CHECKED_CUDA(<ref refid="gpu__safe__operations_8h_1a4ecdf944440947b7052c1b8fd828e74f" kindref="member">cudaMalloc</ref>(&amp;ptr,<sp/>size));<sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>captured<sp/>in<sp/>guard</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>CHECKED_CUDA(cudaMemcpy(...));</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>On<sp/>scope<sp/>exit,<sp/>guard&apos;s<sp/>destructor<sp/>checks<sp/>if<sp/>error<sp/>occurred</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">if</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>(final_error<sp/>!=<sp/><ref refid="namespacethemis_1_1gpu_1afe088b91efd54af07cd72da337205c6bad0749aaba8b833466dfcbb0428e4f89c" kindref="member">GPUDispatchErrorCode::SUCCESS</ref>)<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Execute<sp/>CPU<sp/>fallback</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
